  "policyDifferences": [
    "Original target is based on packer payload size and concurrent pack managers; stage includes header/trailer and sequential admission.",
    "Original streams temporary pack payloads, merges pending packers, and randomizes pack selection; stage owns bounded encrypted payload buffers.",
    "Original index tracks pending IDs and serializes every distinct row; stage tracks pending verified data IDs and actual loaded row count."
  ]
